  "securityReview": [
    "Heartbeat writes retain each dispatch execution context and still require the current owner, fencing token and unexpired lease. Revoked authority is not bypassed.",
    "Unsettled responses never execute tool calls or become accepted results. Only read-only steps with current trust and no recorded authorization block may retain a redacted draft and receive one policy-permitted retry.",
